invalid type: string "Chapter 7 - Visitor Information\nOpening Hours\nSunny Hills Farm is open to visitors from March to December. The farm is closed in\nJanuary and February, when the animals and staff rest and maintenance work is done.\n- March to October: 9:30 in the morning to 5:00 in the evening, every day\n- November and December: 10:00 in the morning to 4:00 in the afternoon, every day\n po